      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Once Banijer is rank 1 and has a physical body, he gains the following primal innate spells. As his rank increases, his primal spell DC and spell attack modifier increase, and he gains additional innate spells.\n\nPrimal Innate Spells DC 22, attack +14; 3rd Cleanse Affliction, Heal; 2nd Cleanse Affliction, Heal, Sure Footing; 1st Cleanse Cuisine, Heal, Mending; Cantrips (3rd) Caustic Blast, Detect Magic, Light, Read Aura, Tangle Vine\n\nRank 2 DC 24, attack +16; 4th Cleanse Affliction; 3rd Water Breathing.\n\nHis cantrips are heightened to 4th rank.\n\nRank 3 DC 26, attack +18; 5th Sure Footing; 4th Heal.\n\nHis cantrips are heightened to 5th rank.",
